                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-6 text-center w-full md:items-end md:gap-12 md:text-right md:max-w-[343.5px]">
                    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 md:items-end">
                        <div class="text-[12px] text-[#1B1B18] leading-[1.4] max-w-[346px] [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:transition-colors [&amp;_a:hover]:text-[#0F64E9] [&amp;_a:focus-visible]:text-[#0F64E9]" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
                            <p>Always discuss Doctronic’s output with a doctor. Doctronic is an AI model trained on medical data, not a licensed doctor, does not practice medicine, and does not provide medical advice or patient care. By using Doctronic, you agree to our <a href="https://www.doctronic.ai/terms-of-service/">Terms of Service</a> &amp; <a href="https://www.doctronic.ai/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

                        </div>
                        
    <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-[12px] text-[#000000] leading-[1.4] md:justify-end" style="letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        <a href="https://www.doctronic.ai/do-not-sell/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-privacy-choices-link="footer" class="underline hover:text-[#0F64E9]">Do not sell or share my personal information</a>
